WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.909
Is democracy just choosing leaders?

2
00:00:02.909 --> 00:00:04.679
Or something more?

3
00:00:05.006 --> 00:00:06.663
Joseph Schumpeter,

4
00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:07.549
in 1942,

5
00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:10.086
saw democracy as a method.

6
00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:11.872
Elites compete for the people's

7
00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:12.742
vote.

8
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:16.509
Participatory democrats want people involved

9
00:00:16.509 --> 00:00:17.826
beyond voting.

10
00:00:17.826 --> 00:00:19.360
Deliberative democrats,

11
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.374
like Habermas,

12
00:00:20.374 --> 00:00:23.444
stress public reasoning before decisions.

13
00:00:23.793 --> 00:00:25.421
Gram sabhas are a case

14
00:00:25.421 --> 00:00:26.911
of participation.

15
00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:28.570
Parliamentary committees,

16
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.097
of deliberation.

17
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.637
Your turn.

18
00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:33.608
Whose view is this?
